Description: Hyggshi Desktop Environment
 HDE is a lightweight GTK3 desktop for X11 and Wayland.  It provides the
 panel, desktop icons and wallpaper, file manager, settings, terminal,
 screenshot tool, widgets, notifications, its own window manager (NexWM),
 lock screen, idle handling, automatic mounting of removable drives and
 keyring integration.
 .
 The package installs the HDE (X11) and nexwm sessions.  When the Wayland
 layer-shell components are built, the HDE (Wayland) session is installed
 too; an X11-only build never advertises a Wayland session.
